JS Notebook adapted from IgorWarzocha/howaboua-pi-stuff, merged PR #552
revision 84bd5bce60a77c4298484d4b7c810d4fe5220a1b.
Source: packages/pi-codex-conversion/src/tools/js-mode and the selected-data
graph definitions, remapping, validation and compaction in ts-mode.
Repository: https://github.com/IgorWarzocha/howaboua-pi-stuff

The source checkout was inspected read-only with git show. Integration uses
public Pi Durable APIs, ordinary selected tool registrations and the internal
shared shell implementation. No Pi ExtensionAPI or compatibility wrapper is
carried. QuickJS retains complete VM snapshots without replaying user cells.

QuickJS runtime: quickjs-wasi 3.6.3, MIT, vercel-labs/quickjs-wasi.
WASM loader: @earendil-works/pi-codemode 1.4.0, MIT.
Parser: acorn 8.19.0, MIT.
These are external package dependencies and retain their own licence files.

